<title>FINLAND: ICE HOCKEY-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP RELEGATION ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>ICE HOCKEY-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP RELEGATION ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>TAMPERE, Finland 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of relegation</p>
<p>round matches at the ice hockey world championships on Tuesday:</p>
<p>Slovakia 2 Norway 1 (0-1 1-0 1-0)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Slovakia - Zdenko Ciger (34:06), Roman Kontsek (44:19)</p>
<p>Norway - Ole Dahlstrom (02:42)</p>
<p>Penalties: Slovakia 12 minutes, Norway 12</p>
<p>Attendance: 5,260</p>
</text>
